    tests/test_sha256.odin (~100 LOC NIST test-vectors)
  integration :
    manifest-generation in release.sh currently-uses sha256sum
    after-replacement : parser.exe --sha256 <file> emits hash
    release.sh calls parser.exe instead-of sha256sum
  recommend : keep BOTH paths ← release.sh tries sha256sum first then-falls-back
    ∵ dev-platform variance • Odin-path guarantees portability
  acceptance :
    ✓ NIST test-vectors all-pass
    ✓ parser.exe --sha256 output matches sha256sum on-all-corpus-files
    ✓ manifest.sha256 byte-identical pre/post
    ✓ throughput ≥ 100 MB/s dev-hw

