  integration :
    parser.exe --sign <file> --key=<keyfile>       → signature
    parser.exe --verify <file> --sig=<sigfile> --key=<pubkey>
    m2_audit.py optionally-delegates to-parser.exe instead-of Python-cryptography
  key-management :
    existing dev-stub key ← preserve keys/cslv3-dev.key + .pub
    add parser/keystore.odin (~100 LOC) for-key-loading
